  m_Name: 5.ShaderProperties
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readme
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  title: Shader Properties
  sections:
  - heading: Shader Properties
    text: "Shader Properties\n\nCore Controls\n\nThese parameters define the overall
      fill behavior and blending logic of the progress bar.\n\u2022 Main Bar Fill
      Amount \u2013 Sets how much the main bar is filled (0 = empty, 1 = full).\n\u2022
      Fill Amount \u2013 A global fill driver for all visual systems. Use for synced
      behavior.\n\u2022 Second Bar \u2192 Main Blend \u2013 Blends from the main
      to the second bar (0 = only main, 1 = only second).\n\u2022 Second Bar \u2192
      Invisible Blend \u2013 Fades out the second bar (0 = visible, 1 = fully transparent).\n\u2022
      End Line Visibility \u2013 Toggles the end marker visibility (0 = hidden, 1
      = visible).\n\u2022 General Shape\n\nControls the bar's geometry \u2014 height,
      skew, and corner rounding.\n\u2022 Height \u2013 Sets vertical thickness of
      the bar.\n\u2022 Size Offset (XY) \u2013 Uniform scale offset; useful for layout
      tweaks.\n\u2022 Skew Left/Right (Top/Bottom) \u2013 Tilts corners inward/outward
      for asymmetric shapes.\n\u2022 Skew Edge Position (Left/Right) \u2013 Sets
      vertical anchor point of the skew (0 = bottom, 1 = top).\n\u2022 Skew Invert
      (Left/Right) \u2013 Flips the skew direction.\n\u2022 Roundness \u2013 Applies
      uniform corner rounding.\n\u2022 Roundness (Per-Corner) \u2013 Overrides roundness
      for individual corners.\n\u2022 Custom Shape (Procedural Distortion)\n\nAdds
      animated or static distortion using guide textures.\n\u2022 Enable \u2013 Turns
      on procedural shaping.\n\u2022 Noise Guide 1/2 \u2013 Textures that distort
      the shape (white = neutral, dark/light = push/pull).\n\u2022 Strength (1/2)
      \u2013 How strongly each guide affects the shape.\n\u2022 Scroll Speed (1/2)
      \u2013 Scroll rate of each guide texture for animation.\n\u2022 Use Second
      Texture \u2013 Enables blending in the second guide.\n\u2022 Simple Outline\n\nBasic
      visual outline.\n\u2022 Thickness \u2013 Width of the outline stroke.\n\u2022
      Color \u2013 Outline color (supports HDR and alpha).\n\u2022 Use Color Alpha
      for Blending \u2013 Alpha controls how strongly the outline blends.\n\u2022
      Custom Outline (Advanced)\n\nProcedural, guide-driven outline system.\n\u2022
      Enable \u2013 Enables advanced outline features.\n\u2022 Depends On Fill Amount
      \u2013 Links outline visibility to current fill.\n\u2022 Size / Offset \u2013
      Size and position offset of the outline.\n\u2022 Smoothness \u2013 Edge softness.\n\u2022
      Color \u2013 Main outline color (HDR supported).\n\u2022 Power / Strength \u2013
      Sharpness and visibility blend.\n\u2022 Use Noise Guides \u2013 Enables distortion
      from noise textures.\n\u2022 Noise Guides 1/2 \u2013 Textures, strength, and
      scroll speed as in custom shape.\n\u2022 Shadow\n\nStylized drop shadow behind
      or inside the bar.\n\u2022 Enable \u2013 Activates shadow rendering.\n\u2022
      Size / Smoothness \u2013 Size and edge softness.\n\u2022 Color / Strength /
      Power \u2013 Color, intensity, and edge sharpness.\n\u2022 Fill \u2014 Core\n\nMain
      fill appearance controls.\n\u2022 Skew \u2013 Tilts the fill directionally.\n\u2022
      Use Only Background Alpha \u2013 Limits fill to background shape alpha.\n\u2022
      Background Color \u2013 Sets color of unfilled portion.\n\u2022 Color (No Gradient)
      \u2013 Solid fill color when gradient is off.\n\u2022 Horizontal Gradient \u2013
      Blends left/right fill colors.\n\u2022 Gradient Color Left/Right \u2013 Start/end
      gradient colors.\n\u2022 Fill \u2014 Second Bar\n\nAdds a secondary fill layer.\n\u2022
      Enable \u2013 Turns on the second bar.\n\u2022 Use Only Alpha Channel \u2013
      Ignores RGB, only uses alpha.\n\u2022 Color \u2013 Color of the second bar.\n\u2022
      Fill \u2014 Vertical Darken\n\nAdds vertical shading for depth.\n\u2022 Enable
      \u2013 Activates the effect.\n\u2022 Color / Amount / Power \u2013 Color and
      intensity controls.\n\u2022 Use Flat / Flip \u2013 Uniform darkening or invert
      direction.\n\u2022 Fill \u2014 Overlay Effects\n\nAdds visual layering on top
      of the fill and background.\n\u2022 Enable / Strength \u2013 Master toggle
      and intensity.\n\u2022 Fill / Background Color \u2013 Overlay colors.\n\u2022
      Color / Alpha Impact \u2013 Blend strengths for each channel.\n\u2022 Use Guides
      \u2013 Distort overlay with textures.\n\u2022 Step Offset / Smoothness / Rotation
      / Inverse \u2013 Shape stylization.\n\u2022 Noise Guides 1/2 \u2013 Procedural
      shaping via textures, with scroll speed and strength.\n\u2022 Fill \u2014 Segments\n\nSplits
      the fill into stylized segments.\n\u2022 Enable / Count \u2013 Turns on segments
      and sets how many.\n\u2022 Skew / Width / Edge Smoothness \u2013 Visual styling
      per segment.\n\u2022 Edge Step / Custom Shape Strength \u2013 Adds stylized
      edge transitions or distortion.\n\u2022 Top Strength / Smoothness / Offset
      \u2013 Deform segment tops.\n\u2022 Add Alpha / Multiply Alpha \u2013 Adjust
      opacity per segment.\n\u2022 Color / Strength On Color \u2013 Per-segment color
      and blend strength.\n\u2022 Fill \u2014 Smooth Edge & Texture Guide\n\nRefines
      the fill edge with soft blending or texture shaping.\n\u2022 Enable Smooth
      Edge / Value \u2013 Softens the fill transition.\n\u2022 Enable Edge Guide
      / Texture Guide \u2013 Uses a texture to shape the edge.\n\u2022 Guide Strength
      / Scroll Speed / Flip \u2013 Shape control and animation.\n\u2022 Fill \u2014
      Shadow (Inner)\n\nAdds internal shadowing to the fill and/or background.\n\u2022
      Enable \u2013 Activates internal shadow.\n\u2022 Use Only Color Alpha \u2013
      Uses only alpha for blending.\n\u2022 Color / Power / Amount Multiplier \u2013
      Visual styling and intensity.\n\u2022 Use Hard Step \u2013 Adds a sharp falloff
      edge.\n\u2022 Use Texture Guide / Texture / Flip / Strength / Scroll \u2013
      Procedural shaping via guide textures.\n\u2022 End Line\n\nThin visual marker
      at the end of the fill bar.\n\u2022 Enable \u2013 Turns on the end line.\n\u2022
      Color \u2013 Color of the marker.\n\u2022 Width / Smoothness (Left & Right)
      \u2013 Asymmetrical size and softness.\n\u2022 Offset / Multiplier / Power
      \u2013 Position and intensity controls.\n\u2022 Multiply With Fill Shadow \u2013
      Blends the end line with the fill\u2019s inner shadow."
